{"pages":[{"w":612,"h":792,"ocr":false,"segs":[["TRUE STORY",3.7222000000000008,386.17000000000002,117.54220000000001,427,25,false],["We experience life as a story,",39,427.28679999999997,145.42449999999997,438.22499999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["because life is a story and that",39,437.47879999999998,150.54780000000005,448.42609999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["story goes something like this . . .",39.000000000000007,447.68899999999996,161.8317999999999,458.62719999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["BETRAYAL: We were created for a",39,468.08679999999998,163.67590000000001,479.02499999999998,9.0999999999999996,false],["relationship with God. But our hearts",38.9968,478.28789999999998,176.57969999999989,489.22609999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["turned proud, and pride corrupted. We",38.9968,488.48899999999998,183.63219999999993,499.42719999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["abandoned God and intimacy turned",38.9968,498.69009999999997,178.31779999999989,509.62829999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["to alienation. Humanity is now fallen:",38.9968,508.89119999999997,177.33499999999987,519.82939999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["none",38.9968,519.09230000000002,58.516300000000001,530.03049999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["of us lives or loves as we ought.",62.238200000000006,519.09230000000002,178.91839999999991,530.03049999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["ANTICIPATION: Though we betrayed",39,539.48680000000002,176.50950000000006,550.42499999999995,9.0999999999999996,false],["God, He did not abandon us. Through",38.999400000000009,549.68790000000001,179.56709999999993,560.62609999999995,9.0999999999999996,false],["the prophets God promised to send a",38.999400000000009,559.88900000000001,178.92099999999988,570.82719999999995,9.0999999999999996,false],["Savior (the Messiah) who would restore",38.999400000000009,570.09010000000001,185.84609999999992,581.02829999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["and rescue us from the consequences",38.999400000000009,580.2912,179.89469999999992,591.22939999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["of our sin and betrayal.",38.999400000000009,590.4923,124.23000000000002,601.43049999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["PURSUIT:",39,610.88679999999999,73.849999999999994,621.82500000000005,8.5,false],["As promised, God sent the",77.532700000000006,610.88679999999999,176.00379999999996,621.82500000000005,9.0999999999999996,false],["one who would rescue and restore us.",39.00330000000001,621.08789999999999,180.34449999999993,632.02610000000004,9.0999999999999996,false],["His name was Jesus. The unique Son of",39.00330000000001,631.28899999999999,183.62049999999988,642.22720000000004,9.0999999999999996,false],["God became one of us. He spoke truth,",39.00330000000001,641.49009999999998,183.97539999999987,652.42830000000004,9.0999999999999996,false],["modeled love, granted forgiveness, and",39.00330000000001,651.69119999999998,185.52239999999995,662.62940000000003,9.0999999999999996,false],["offered life in all of its fullness.",39.00330000000001,661.89229999999998,148.38530000000003,672.83050000000003,9.0999999999999996,false],["SACRIFICE: Life’s greatest mystery was",39,682.28679999999997,181.87689999999998,693.22500000000002,9.0999999999999996,false],["revealed in love’s greatest act. Jesus, the",38.997799999999998,692.48789999999997,187.84649999999988,703.42610000000002,9.0999999999999996,false],["author of life, died for us: taking upon",38.997799999999998,702.68899999999996,179.25609999999989,713.62720000000002,9.0999999999999996,false],["himself our guilt and atoning for our",38.997799999999998,712.89009999999996,174.73339999999985,723.82830000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["sin. How can we be sure? God raised Je-",38.997799999999998,723.09119999999996,186.87279999999998,734.02940000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["sus from the dead. He is alive today and",38.997799999999984,733.29229999999995,186.61799999999985,744.23050000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["offers life to all who would receive it.",38.997799999999984,743.49339999999995,174.74249999999989,754.4316,9.0999999999999996,false],["THE HERO WINS",264,219.29600000000005,464.798,251.25,26,false],["IN THE END",264,240.30400000000009,407,272.25800000000004,26,false],["BUT HE DIES",297.36000000000001,257.56899999999996,533.54399999999998,305.5,39,false],["IN THE MIDDLE.",297.32099999999997,288.57400000000001,587.67599999999993,336.505,39,false],["THE GIFT:",204.40910000000002,498.01899999999995,240.10060000000004,508.95719999999994,8.5,false],["Now God invites us to come",243.78330000000003,498.01899999999995,348.38779999999997,508.95719999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["back to him through trusting in Jesus.",204.40760000000003,508.22009999999995,345.02079999999989,519.15829999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["Forgiveness is a free and undeserved",204.40760000000003,518.4212,341.7811999999999,529.35939999999994,9.0999999999999996,false],["gift, received only through genuine",204.40760000000003,528.6223,336.52139999999991,539.56049999999993,9.0999999999999996,false],["faith in Jesus Christ.",204.40760000000003,538.82339999999999,277.74450000000007,549.76159999999993,9.0999999999999996,false],["My Father’s will is that everyone who",204.40760000000003,559.2165,334.61040000000003,570.16379999999992,9.0999999999999996,false],["looks to the son and believes in him shall",204.40760000000003,569.41759999999999,348.9428999999999,580.36489999999992,9.0999999999999996,false],["have eternal life, and I will raise him up at",204.40760000000003,579.61869999999999,351.1905999999999,590.56599999999992,9.0999999999999996,false],["the last day. —John 6:40",204.40760000000003,589.81889999999999,291.44270000000006,600.76709999999991,9.0999999999999996,false],["This is the story—our story—from",204.40910000000002,610.21889999999996,331.80909999999994,621.15710000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["rebellion to reunion: our journey back",204.40910000000002,620.41999999999996,345.56829999999991,631.35820000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["to intimacy with God.",204.40910000000002,630.62109999999996,284.76210000000003,641.55930000000001,9.0999999999999996,false],["A TURNING POINT? All good stories",204.40910000000002,651.01890000000003,335.56060000000002,661.95709999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["have turning points and this could be",204.41140000000001,661.22000000000003,344.26019999999994,672.15819999999997,9.0999999999999996,false],["the turning point of your story. If you",204.41140000000001,671.42110000000002,342.03069999999991,682.35929999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["desire to turn to God and receive Christ,",204.41140000000001,681.62220000000002,352.52299999999991,692.56039999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["you can express that right now to God,",204.41140000000001,691.82330000000002,348.68279999999993,702.76149999999996,9.0999999999999996,false],["silently, in prayer.",204.41140000000001,702.02440000000001,268.56640000000004,712.96259999999995,9.0999999999999996,false],["If you’d like to find out more, go to EVERYSTUDENT.COM",204.40910000000002,733.77739999999994,411.74160000000001,744.71559999999999,9.0999999999999996,false],["where millions of students have gone to explore faith.",204.40610000000001,743.97849999999994,405.06110000000001,754.91669999999999,9.0999999999999996,false]]}]}